Chapter: WorkStations
  cites Uoaix chapter BritainShops

 Station tiles are ServUO Data/Decoration/Britannia/britain.cfg, GPL-2.0; ports/ServUO-LICENSE.txt:
 AnvilEastAddon 0x0FAF at 1423,1556,30 and SmallForgeAddon 0x0FB1 at 1424,1558,30 in the yard of
 The Hammer And Anvil; StoneOvenEastAddon 0x092C at 1448,1615,20 in Good Eats; LoomSouthAddon 0x1061
 at 1473,1685,0 in The Lords Clothiers. ServUO DefBlacksmithy.CheckAnvilAndForge and Smelt accept an
 anvil or forge within 2 tiles.

  wks-anvil : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1423, y = 1556, z = 30 }
  wks-forge : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1424, y = 1558, z = 30 }
  wks-oven : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1448, y = 1615, z = 20 }
  wks-loom : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1473, y = 1685, z = 0 }
 ServUO britain.cfg SpinningWheelSouthAddon 0x101C at 1473,1689,0, four tiles south of the loom in The Lords Clothiers.
  wks-wheel : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1473, y = 1689, z = 0 }
 The Tinkers' Guild workbenches are the tables at x 1424 and 1428 holding ServUO britain.cfg's gears, springs, axles,
 clock frames and sextant parts (z 16 on the tables' z 10); the station is the bench at 1424,1650.
  wks-tinker : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1424, y = 1650, z = 10 }
 The Saw Horse's carpentry bench is the table at 1431,1596 holding britain.cfg's saw (0x1034) and planes at z 26.
  wks-saw-bench : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1431, y = 1596, z = 20 }
 Britain's decoration has no mill (root, 2026-10-06: place one at the bakery): ServUO FlourMillEastAddon's components
 0x1920, 0x1922 and 0x1924 at x - 1, x and x + 1, on Good Eats' free row 1449..1451,1617 at its floor z 20.
  wks-mill : BbSpot = BbSpot { x = 1450, y = 1617, z = 20 }
  wks-mill-art : List Integer = [#1920, #1922, #1924]
  wks-reach : Integer = 2
  wks-beside : Integer, Integer, BbSpot -> Boolean
  wks-beside (x) (y) (s) = walk-abs (x - s.x) <= wks-reach & walk-abs (y - s.y) <= wks-reach
  wks-near : WorldObject, BbSpot -> Boolean
  wks-near (m) (s) = wks-beside m.x m.y s
  wks-smithing : WorldObject -> Boolean
  wks-smithing (m) = wks-near m wks-anvil & wks-near m wks-forge
  wks-on : Integer, Integer, BbSpot -> Boolean
  wks-on (x) (y) (s) = y == s.y & (x == s.x | (s.x == wks-mill.x & s.y == wks-mill.y & walk-abs (x - s.x) <= 1))
  wks-spot : WorldTable, WalkMap, BbSpot, BbSpot, Integer -> Result BbSpot Text
  wks-spot (world) (map) (a) (b) (i) = if i == 25 then Err "no free tile beside the station"
    else let x = a.x - wks-reach + int-mod i 5
    in let y = a.y - wks-reach + i / 5
    in if not (wks-beside x y b) | wks-on x y a | wks-on x y b then wks-spot world map a b (i + 1)
    else when bb-placement world map (BbShop { title = "Station", premises = "Station", x1 = x, y1 = y, x2 = x, y2 = y }) 0
      is Err (_) -> wks-spot world map a b (i + 1)
      is Ok (spot) -> Ok spot
 Residents 0, 1 and 2 (Nell the baker, Jorin the smith, Mira the tailor) work at the oven, the anvil beside
 the forge, and the loom.
  wks-trade-a : Integer -> BbSpot
  wks-trade-a (i) = if i == 0 then wks-oven else if i == 1 then wks-anvil else wks-loom
  wks-trade-b : Integer -> BbSpot
  wks-trade-b (i) = if i == 1 then wks-forge else wks-trade-a i
  wks-at-trade : Integer, BbSpot -> Boolean
  wks-at-trade (i) (spot) = wks-beside spot.x spot.y (wks-trade-a i) & wks-beside spot.x spot.y (wks-trade-b i)
  wks-trade-spot : WorldTable, WalkMap, Integer -> Result BbSpot Text
  wks-trade-spot (world) (map) (i) = wks-spot world map (wks-trade-a i) (wks-trade-b i) 0
